刻，一会儿；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"조금","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61176","senseId":"2","lemma":"조금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"조금만","audio":"/audio/61e4375f0847dd284eb0.mp3"}},{"text":"놀아","meaning":"玩耍，玩乐","explanation":"놀다：玩耍，玩乐；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"놀다","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88353","senseId":"1","lemma":"놀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놀아","audio":"/audio/534793f8630362d2ba1b.mp3"}},{"text":"줬는데도","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"줬는데도","audio":"/audio/9648594a689eb6a3995a.mp3"}},{"text":"아이들이","meaning":"小孩，孩子","explanation":"아이：小孩，孩子；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"1","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아이들이","audio":"/audio/ac32747784d62b1df40f.mp3"}},{"text":"무척","meaning":"非常，很","explanation":"무척：非常，很","readings":[{"term":"무척","audio":"/audio/9d4e17cb57a7915a0528.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55175","senseId":"1","lemma":"무척","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무척","audio":"/audio/9d4e17cb57a7915a0528.mp3"}},{"text":"즐거워하더라.","meaning":"高兴，愉悦","explanation":"즐거워하다：高兴，愉悦；더라：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"즐거워하다","audio":"/audio/49a628a113a5156758f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27742","senseId":"1","lemma":"즐거워하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"즐거워하더라","audio":"/audio/455e92a70ab361119b49.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6d08580e9b088153","term":"맞다","zh":"对","a